      "id": 1,
      "text": "Swords Creek was founded by hunters Henry and Michael Sword, after whom the community was named.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swords_Creek%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sits where Swords Creek meets the Clinch River, right at the junction of State Routes 67 and 633.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
